  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Fund 2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strategic Fund 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med strategiska fonden &#xe4;r att finansiera mindre initiativ som &#xe4;r strategiska f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av strategin f&#xf6;r utvecklingssamarbete f&#xf6;r Kambodja, men det faller utanf&#xf6;r ramen f&#xf6;r de st&#xf6;rre bidragen inom respektive resultatomr&#xe5;den / sektorer. Initiativ som kan finansieras genom strategiska fonden &#xe4;r f&#xf6;rberedande studier f&#xf6;re m&#xf6;jliga bed&#xf6;mningar, recensioner och utv&#xe4;rderingar, studiebes&#xf6;k, &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttningar och publikationer. Kostnader relaterade till kambodjans deltagande i ITP-kurser i Sverige kommer ocks&#xe5; att finansieras inom fonden. Bidrag som &#xe4;r begr&#xe4;nsade i tid och arbetsbelastning, till exempel betalning av angivna kostnadsobjekt f&#xf6;r en konferens, kan ocks&#xe5; finansieras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose with the Strategic Fund is to finance smaller initiatives which are strategic for the implementation of the Development Cooperation Strategy for Cambodia, but that fall outside the framework of the larger contributions in the respective result areas/sectors. Initiatives that can be financed through the Strategic Fund are preparatory studies prior to possible assessments, reviews and evaluations, study visits, translations and publications. Costs related to Cambodian&apos;s participation in ITP courses in Sweden will also be financed under the fund. Contributions that are limited in time and workload, such as payment of specified cost items for a conference, may also be financed.</narrative>
  </description>
